# highrise

[![make.fun · gta6-01](https://make.fun/badge/gta6-01.svg)](https://make.fun/bounty/gta6-01?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=gta6-01)
[![rank](https://make.fun/badge/gta6-01/cwybruce/highrise/rank.svg)](https://make.fun/bounty/gta6-01/leaderboard?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=gta6-01)
[![reward](https://make.fun/badge/gta6-01/cwybruce/highrise/reward.svg)](https://make.fun/bounty/gta6-01?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=gta6-01)

Highrise is a rooftop heist at noon in Port Vane: you are a climber on the crew building the Port Vane Tower — lift the blueprints, steal the site pickup, outrun security and the police across the district, then climb the tower crane and vanish from the top.

## Run it

```sh
node serve.ts
```

Then open http://localhost:8080 in your browser.

